  "mach:judgement": "Assess",
  "mach:judgementReason": "The most direct on-ramp to EHR foundation model training for teams already in the HuggingFace ecosystem. Ships pretrained GPT/Llama/Mamba/Hyena models on 2B structured EHR tokens; FEMR's own docs recommend it for autoregressive training. Apache 2.0, Shah Lab provenance, paper at arXiv. Assess because it is pre-1.0 with 46 stars — community adoption is still early. Pair with FEMR (masked/CLMBR-style) and EHRSHOT (evaluation) for a full Shah Lab EHR stack.",
  "mach:editorialReviewedAt": "2026-05-16",
